          "text": "BUNDLE_START\n{\"path\":\"about.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>About — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{\\n      --bg1:#0f1724; --bg2:#09203f; --accent:#f6d365; --muted:#cbd5e1; --glass:rgba(255,255,255,0.06);\\n      --max:1100px; --radius:18px;\\n      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, \\\"Segoe UI\\\", Roboto, \\\"Helvetica Neue\\\", Arial;\\n    }\\n    html,body{height:100%;margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg1),var(--bg2));color:#f8fafc}\\n    .wrap{max-width:var(--max);margin:40px auto;padding:28px}\\n    header{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:16px}\\n    .brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px}\\n    .logo{width:56px;height:56px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),#ff9a8b);display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:700;color:#07243a}\\n    nav a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:14px;font-size:15px}\\n    /* split diagonal hero */\\n    .hero{position:relative;margin-top:20px;border-radius:var(--radius);overflow:hidden;color:#06202b}\\n    .hero .left{background:linear-gradient(160deg,rgba(246,211,101,0.12),rgba(255,154,139,0.10));padding:44px 36px;clip-path:polygon(0 0,68% 0,55% 100%,0 100%)}\\n    .hero .right{position:absolute;right:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:38%;background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(3,37,65,0.8),rgba(6,30,48,0.9));padding:36px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center}\\n    h1{margin:0;font-size:38px;line-height:1.05;color:#04202a}\\n    p.lead{color:#072a36;margin-top:12px;font-size:16px}\\n    .card{background:var(--glass);padding:18px;border-radius:12px;color:var(--muted);box-shadow:0 6px 30px rgba(2,6,23,0.6);}\\n    .grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:20px;margin-top:22px}\\n    ul{padding-left:18px}\\n    .cta{display:inline-block;margin-top:16px;padding:12px 18px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#ff9a8b);color:#07243a;border-radius:12px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700}\\n    footer{margin-top:40px;padding-top:24px;border-top:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.03);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}\\n    /* subtle pattern */\\n    .pattern{position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:0.08}\\n    @media(max-width:880px){.grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;} .hero .right{position:relative;width:100% ;clip-path:none}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div class=\\\"brand\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"logo\\\">SB</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">{{TAGLINE}}</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav aria-label=\\\"Main\\\">\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"events.html\\\">Gatherings</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">Membership</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\">Connect</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <main>\\n      <section class=\\\"hero\\\" aria-labelledby=\\\"about-hero\\\">\\n        <svg class=\\\"pattern\\\" viewBox=\\\"0 0 800 500\\\" preserveAspectRatio=\\\"none\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\">\\n          <defs>\\n            <linearGradient id=\\\"g\\\" x1=\\\"0\\\" x2=\\\"1\\\">\\n              <stop offset=\\\"0\\\" stop-color=\\\"#f6d365\\\" />\\n              <stop offset=\\\"1\\\" stop-color=\\\"#ff9a8b\\\" />\\n            </linearGradient>\\n            <filter id=\\\"grain\\\"><feTurbulence baseFrequency=\\\"0.8\\\" numOctaves=\\\"1\\\" stitchTiles=\\\"stitch\\\" /><feColorMatrix type=\\\"saturate\\\" values=\\\"0\\\" /></filter>\\n          </defs>\\n          <rect width=\\\"100%\\\" height=\\\"100%\\\" fill=\\\"url(#g)\\\" filter=\\\"url(#grain)\\\" />\\n        </svg>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"left\\\">\\n          <h1 id=\\\"about-hero\\\">A slow unraveling of sound — the story behind {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</h1>\\n          <p class=\\\"lead\\\">We design evenings that feel like a warm tide: held, intentional, and layered with pure tone.\\n          Facilitated by {{FACILITATOR_NAME}}, our gatherings blend careful listening with a membership practice that turns single sessions into a ritual of restoration.</p>\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"card\\\" style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\">\\n            <strong>Our sensorial palette</strong>\\n            <p style=\\\"margin:8px 0 0;color:var(--muted)\\\">We sculpt space with a curated selection of instruments. Expect subtle crystalline swell and morning-light harmonics.</p>\\n            <ul style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">\\n              <li>Crystal singing bowls tuned to supportive intervals</li>\\n              <li>Koshi chimes & soft bell textures</li>\\n              <li>Hemp-damped Tibetan bowls for earthy resonance</li>\\n            </ul>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <aside class=\\\"right\\\">\\n          <div style=\\\"color:var(--muted);font-size:13px\\\">Join our circle — become a member for priority booking and quiet benefits</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700;font-size:20px;margin-top:8px\\\">Membership from $39/mo</div>\\n          <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"pricing.html\\\">View membership plans</a>\\n        </aside>\\n      </section>\\n\\n      <section class=\\\"grid\\\">\\n        <article>\\n          <h2 style=\\\"color:#fdf6ec\\\">How a sound bath unfolds</h2>\\n          <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">We guide you through a gentle arc so the senses can settle: a short greeting, grounding breath work, a reclining journey of layered tones, and a peaceful close with time to reorient.</p>\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin-top:14px;color:#f6e7d0\\\">Typical flow</h3>\\n          <ol style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n            <li>Arrive 15 minutes early — settle, hydrate, and choose your place.</li>\\n            <li>Brief intention-setting and gentle breath practice.</li>\\n            <li>Sound journey — 30–50 minutes of continuous immersion.</li>\\n            <li>Soft return — tea, silence, and optional check-ins.</li>\\n          </ol>\\n\\n          <h3 style=\\\"margin-top:14px;color:#f6e7d0\\\">What to bring</h3>\\n          <ul style=\\\"color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n            <li>A yoga mat or thick blanket to lie on</li>\\n            <li>A small cushion for neck support and an extra blanket for warmth</li>\\n            <li>Water bottle and any small comforts — eye mask, socks</li>\\n          </ul>\\n        </article>\\n\\n        <aside>\\n          <div class=\\\"card\\\">\\n            <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#fff\\\">Safety & contraindications</h4>\\n            <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 8px 0\\\">Sound baths are deeply relaxing but not suitable in all cases. If you are pregnant, have uncontrolled epilepsy, severe psychiatric conditions, implanted medical devices, or recent surgery, please consult your healthcare provider and contact us before attending.</p>\\n            <a href=\\\"faq.html\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">See full FAQ</a>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:18px\\\" class=\\\"card\\\">\\n            <h4 style=\\\"margin:0 0 8px 0;color:#fff\\\">Facilitator</h4>\\n            <p style=\\\"color:var(--muted);margin:0\\\">{{FACILITATOR_NAME}} cultivates a slow, attentive approach — trained in somatic listening, sound craft, and group container care. Small groups ensure safety and intimate depth.</p>\\n            <a class=\\\"cta\\\" href=\\\"book.html\\\" style=\\\"display:inline-block;margin-top:12px\\\">Reserve a spot</a>\\n          </div>\\n        </aside>\\n      </section>\\n\\n    </main>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <div>&copy; <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong> • Serving {{CITY}}, {{STATE}}</div>\\n      <div style=\\\"text-align:right\\\">Questions? <a href=\\\"contact.html\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted);text-decoration:underline\\\">Get in touch</a> • <a href=\\\"privacy.html\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--muted);text-decoration:underline\\\">Privacy</a></div>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"faq.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Help & FAQs — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#071019;--card:#0b1520;--muted:#99a3b2;--accent:#ffd7a6}\\n    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#041424);color:#eaf2f6;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Arial}\\n    .wrap{max-width:980px;margin:40px auto;padding:28px}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    header a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:12px}\\n    h1{margin:12px 0 6px 0}\\n    .lead{color:var(--muted)}\\n    .faq-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:18px;margin-top:20px}\\n    .qa{background:var(--card);padding:18px;border-radius:12px}\\n    .question{font-weight:700;color:#fff}\\n    .answer{color:var(--muted);margin-top:6px}\\n    .aside{position:relative}\\n    .stamp{background:linear-gradient(90deg,#fff3cc,#ffd7a6);color:#04202a;padding:12px;border-radius:10px;font-weight:700}\\n    ul{color:var(--muted)}\\n    footer{margin-top:30px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    @media(max-width:840px){.faq-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"width:50px;height:50px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffd7a6,#ffb4a2);border-radius:10px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:700;color:#04202a\\\">SB</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Curated sound gatherings & quiet membership</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Begin</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"events.html\\\">Schedule</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"private-sessions.html\\\">Private</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"book.html\\\">Book</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <h1>Frequently asked questions</h1>\\n    <p class=\\\"lead\\\">Short answers, kindly delivered. If your question isn't listed, please email <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a>.</p>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"faq-grid\\\">\\n      <div>\\n        <div class=\\\"qa\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom:12px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"question\\\">What should I bring to a session?</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"answer\\\">Bring a yoga mat or thick blanket to lie on, a small cushion for neck support, an extra blanket to stay warm, and water. Eye masks and earplugs are optional. Wear comfortable, layered clothing.</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"qa\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom:12px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"question\\\">Are sound baths safe? Any contraindications?</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"answer\\\">Generally yes, but not always. If you are pregnant, have epilepsy, recent head injury, serious psychiatric diagnoses, or implanted medical devices (e.g., pacemaker), consult your doctor and contact us beforehand. This is not a replacement for medical care.</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"qa\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom:12px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"question\\\">How long is a typical session?</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"answer\\\">Public group sessions typically run 60–90 minutes including arrival and closing. The immersive sound portion is usually 30–50 minutes depending on the event. Private sessions vary by format.</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"qa\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom:12px\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"question\\\">I notice different instruments used — what will I hear?</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"answer\\\">Our instrument palette changes by setting. Expect a careful mix of timbres such as a warm gong swell, a harmonic monochord layer, crystal bowls, and small metallic resonators for clarity. We avoid harsh, sudden sounds.</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div class=\\\"qa\\\">\\n          <div class=\\\"question\\\">Do you offer memberships or packages?</div>\\n          <div class=\\\"answer\\\">Yes — monthly memberships offer priority booking, guest passes, and discounted private sessions. See <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">pricing</a> for current tiers.</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"aside\\\">\\n        <div class=\\\"stamp\\\">Before you arrive</div>\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:14px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n          <strong style=\\\"color:#fff\\\">Arrival tips</strong>\\n          <ul style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">\\n            <li>Arrive 10–15 min early to settle.</li>\\n            <li>Phones off or in airplane mode.</li>\\n            <li>Inform staff of any specific needs.</li>\\n          </ul>\\n          <div style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">Need to cancel? Please give at least 24 hours notice so a waiting guest can join.</div>\\n        </div>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:14px;padding:12px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#08374a,#0b2330);border-radius:10px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n          <strong style=\\\"color:#fff\\\">Private & special sessions</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:8px 0 0\\\">We offer 1:1 restorative sessions, couples ceremonies, and tailored corporate meditative sound experiences. See the private page for details.</p>\\n          <a href=\\\"private-sessions.html\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">Explore private offerings</a>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <p style=\\\"margin-top:28px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Questions remain? Call <strong>{{PHONE}}</strong> or email <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \n{\"path\":\"book.html\",\"content\":\"<!doctype html>\\n<html lang=\\\"en\\\">\\n<head>\\n  <meta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\n  <meta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\\\">\\n  <title>Book — {{BUSINESS_NAME}}</title>\\n  <style>\\n    :root{--bg:#071322;--panel:#082733;--muted:#b9c6d0;--accent:#ffd1a3}\\n    body{margin:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--bg),#041324);color:#eaf6f9;font-family:Inter,system-ui,Arial}\\n    .wrap{max-width:960px;margin:36px auto;padding:28px}\\n    header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}\\n    header a{color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none;margin-left:12px}\\n    .hero{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:18px;gap:20px}\\n    .hero .text{max-width:62%}\\n    h1{margin:0 0 8px 0}\\n    .form-panel{background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.02),transparent);padding:18px;border-radius:14px;box-shadow:0 6px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.6)}\\n    label{display:block;font-size:13px;margin-top:12px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    input,select,textarea{width:100%;padding:10px;border-radius:10px;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);background:transparent;color:#fff;margin-top:6px}\\n    .row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:12px}\\n    .cta{margin-top:14px;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(90deg,var(--accent),#ffb48e);color:#06202a;border-radius:10px;border:none;font-weight:700}\\n    .note{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-top:10px}\\n    .info{margin-top:18px;color:var(--muted)}\\n    footer{margin-top:26px;color:var(--muted);font-size:13px}\\n    @media(max-width:800px){.hero{flex-direction:column}.hero .text{max-width:100%}.row{grid-template-columns:1fr}}\\n  </style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n  <div class=\\\"wrap\\\">\\n    <header>\\n      <div style=\\\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px\\\">\\n        <div style=\\\"width:44px;height:44px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffd1a3,#ffb4a2);border-radius:8px;display:grid;place-items:center;color:#04202a;font-weight:700\\\">SB</div>\\n        <div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-weight:700\\\">{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</div>\\n          <div style=\\\"font-size:13px;color:var(--muted)\\\">Reserve your experience</div>\\n        </div>\\n      </div>\\n      <nav>\\n        <a href=\\\"index.html\\\">Home</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"events.html\\\">Events</a>\\n        <a href=\\\"faq.html\\\">Help</a>\\n      </nav>\\n    </header>\\n\\n    <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n      <div class=\\\"text\\\">\\n        <h1>Reserve a session</h1>\\n        <p class=\\\"note\\\">Choose a public session, a private 1:1, a couples ceremony, or a guided session for your team. Members receive booking priority and savings at checkout.</p>\\n        <p class=\\\"info\\\">Next available public session: <strong style=\\\"color:var(--accent)\\\">{{NEXT_EVENT_DATE}}</strong></p>\\n      </div>\\n\\n      <aside class=\\\"form-panel\\\" style=\\\"width:360px\\\">\\n        <form id=\\\"booking\\\" action=\\\"{{PRIMARY_CTA_URL}}\\\" method=\\\"post\\\">\\n          <label for=\\\"type\\\">Session type</label>\\n          <select id=\\\"type\\\" name=\\\"type\\\">\\n            <option>Public: group sound bath</option>\\n            <option>Private: 1:1 restorative</option>\\n            <option>Couples: shared ceremony</option>\\n            <option>Corporate: tailored meditative experience</option>\\n          </select>\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"date\\\">Preferred date</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"date\\\" name=\\\"date\\\" type=\\\"date\\\" min=\\\"2026-02-01\\\">\\n\\n          <div class=\\\"row\\\">\\n            <div>\\n              <label for=\\\"name\\\">Full name</label>\\n              <input id=\\\"name\\\" name=\\\"name\\\" type=\\\"text\\\" required>\\n            </div>\\n            <div>\\n              <label for=\\\"phone\\\">Phone</label>\\n              <input id=\\\"phone\\\" name=\\\"phone\\\" type=\\\"tel\\\" placeholder=\\\"{{PHONE}}\\\">\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"email\\\">Email</label>\\n          <input id=\\\"email\\\" name=\\\"email\\\" type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"{{EMAIL}}\\\" required>\\n\\n          <label for=\\\"notes\\\">Notes / accessibility</label>\\n          <textarea id=\\\"notes\\\" name=\\\"notes\\\" rows=\\\"3\\\" placeholder=\\\"Let us know if you have special needs.\\\"></textarea>\\n\\n          <label style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\"><input type=\\\"checkbox\\\" name=\\\"member\\\"> I am a member (apply membership benefits)</label>\\n\\n          <button class=\\\"cta\\\" type=\\\"submit\\\">{{PRIMARY_CTA_LABEL}}</button>\\n          <div class=\\\"note\\\">By booking you agree to our small-group guidelines and cancellation policy. A confirmation will be sent to the email above.</div>\\n        </form>\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <section style=\\\"margin-top:18px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 320px;gap:18px\\\">\\n      <article style=\\\"background:linear-gradient(180deg,rgba(255,255,255,0.01),transparent);padding:16px;border-radius:12px\\\">\\n        <h3 style=\\\"margin-top:0\\\">What to expect</h3>\\n        <p class=\\\"note\\\">Sessions are intentionally slow. We begin with gentle arrival, short breathwork, and then a layered sound journey. The instruments and textures vary; our current palette focuses on warm low-frequency resonance and crystalline harmonics.</p>\\n\\n        <h4 style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">Example instruments for bookings</h4>\\n        <ul class=\\\"note\\\">\\n          <li>Gong for deep, long-form washes</li>\\n          <li>Monochord for sustained harmonic bed</li>\\n          <li>Small metal tuning forks for bright accents</li>\\n        </ul>\\n\\n        <h4 style=\\\"margin-top:12px\\\">Contraindications</h4>\\n        <p class=\\\"note\\\">If you have implanted electrical medical devices, epilepsy, are pregnant, or have recent surgery, please consult your provider and contact us before attending. Sound affects the nervous system; we prioritize safety and will suggest alternatives where needed.</p>\\n      </article>\\n\\n      <aside style=\\\"background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02);padding:14px;border-radius:12px;color:var(--muted)\\\">\\n        <strong style=\\\"color:#fff\\\">Pricing & membership</strong>\\n        <p style=\\\"margin-top:8px\\\">Public sessions start at $28. Private sessions and corporate rates vary — see <a href=\\\"pricing.html\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">pricing</a>. Members save on every booking and receive early access to limited events.</p>\\n\\n        <div style=\\\"margin-top:10px\\\">\\n          <strong style=\\\"color:#fff\\\">Need help booking?</strong>\\n          <p style=\\\"margin:6px 0 0\\\">Call <a href=\\\"tel:{{PHONE}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{PHONE}}</a> or email <a href=\\\"mailto:{{EMAIL}}\\\" style=\\\"color:var(--accent);text-decoration:none\\\">{{EMAIL}}</a></p>\\n        </div>\\n      </aside>\\n    </section>\\n\\n    <footer>\\n      <p style=\\\"margin-top:22px;color:var(--muted)\\\">If you'd like a tailored corporate or off-site experience, mention approximate headcount and goals in the notes. We'll follow up with a custom proposal.</p>\\n    </footer>\\n  </div>\\n</body>\\n</html>\"} \nBUNDLE_END"
        }
